I'll generally drop down and visit the mines as soon as I find
them, and I almost always visit minetown before Sokoban.  The
mines aren't that tough, if you stay near the up stairs (to be
able to flee), and let your pet do most of the killing.  There
may be more monsters, but for the most part, they aren't that
tough, and they respect the E word.  They are, in fact, ideal
for building up the strength of your pet.  And getting your
AC down---that's where I usually find mithral, boots and a
helmet.  Sometimes, even a +5 dwarvish cloak:-).  And as you
say, a pick-axe and ranged weapons.

